{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Woohoo! I signed up for a meditation course at a retreat near a lake. Can't wait to share this experience with my partner and learn some new techniques. Sooo excited!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-c388ba768bfc5c5f50e9a1d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.070576+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c388ba768bfc5c5f50e9a1d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c388ba768bfc5c5f50e9a1d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That`s awesome! It looks so calm in the pic - I hope you enjoy your experience and learn some new techniques!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-29b45c7e3827db57114a62a7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.090441+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "29b45c7e3827db57114a62a7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "29b45c7e3827db57114a62a7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: It's amazing how something so easy can make such a big difference to our health!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-6f9cd68da9c071e4ecdc0be5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.104445+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6f9cd68da9c071e4ecdc0be5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6f9cd68da9c071e4ecdc0be5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Yep, it's become part of my routine now. Can't imagine my life without it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-409cd4dc77ff8078138dedc9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.112921+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "409cd4dc77ff8078138dedc9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "409cd4dc77ff8078138dedc9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Yeah, same! It helps me stay balanced during my studies."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-b0fea5f8da0725d2f96742ee", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.126679+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b0fea5f8da0725d2f96742ee", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b0fea5f8da0725d2f96742ee", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Glad to hear it, Jolene. How's the project going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-157cbc1d0efd8c6760450795", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.140604+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "157cbc1d0efd8c6760450795", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "157cbc1d0efd8c6760450795", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: It's tough but I'm chugging along. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-81aee44ffb1567af70b8548d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.154412+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "81aee44ffb1567af70b8548d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "81aee44ffb1567af70b8548d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: You're so strong for handling all the challenges. You've got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-0484ffb3fa14a9e95b1264e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.163759+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0484ffb3fa14a9e95b1264e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0484ffb3fa14a9e95b1264e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb! Your support really means a lot. I'll keep pushing forward."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-fb88fdea71b879503b8d3360", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.174844+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fb88fdea71b879503b8d3360", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fb88fdea71b879503b8d3360", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: No worries, Jolene. I'm here if you need me. Take care of yourself and don't forget to rest up."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-091d987f42305fe6835f1ea0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.191544+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "091d987f42305fe6835f1ea0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "091d987f42305fe6835f1ea0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: What have you been doing lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-48/session_25-9d6fce1e147834d0b87901b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:15:11.202675+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d6fce1e147834d0b87901b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d6fce1e147834d0b87901b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
